# --- Generated skill links (never committed) ---
# tools/generate-ai-configs.ps1 creates one junction/symlink per .agents/skills/*
# here, because Claude Code only discovers skills under .claude/skills/. These
# are machine-local links, regenerated by the script on any clone. They must NOT
# be committed: git does not store a junction — it would follow it and commit a
# full second copy of every skill, which is exactly the duplicate source of
# truth this whole scheme exists to prevent.
.claude/skills/
